9141454b83c3f5793c2fe02a23818415","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Randomly generate actors subject to a filter and/or create random bosses according to a data table.\nFilters are interpreted by game.zone:checkFilter.\n#ORANGE#Boss Data:#LAST# is interpreted by game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, and Actor.levelupClass.\nGeneration is performed within the _G environment (used by the Lua Console) using the current zone's #LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#.\nPress #GOLD#'F1'#LAST# for help.\nMouse over controls for an actor preview (which may be further adjusted when placed on to the level).\n(Press #GOLD#'L'#LAST# to lua inspect or #GOLD#'C'#LAST# to open the character sheet.)\n\nThe #LIGHT_BLUE#Base Filter#LAST# is used to filter the actor randomly generated.","source_tag":"_t","target":"根据给定的筛选器随机生成角色，或/并根据给定的数据表生成随机Boss。\n筛选器由game.zone:checkFilter处理。\n#ORANGE#Boss数据：#LAST#由 game.state:createRandomBoss, game.state:applyRandomClass, 和 Actor.levelupClass处理。\n生成过程在 _G 环境下进行 (也是Lua控制台使用的环境)，并使用当前地图的#LIGHT_GREEN#npc_list#LAST#。\n请按#GOLD#'F1'#LAST#获得帮助。\n鼠标移动查看角色预览（可以在添加到游戏之前进行进一步的调整）\n(请按 #GOLD#'L'#LAST# 在Lua中检查，或按 #GOLD#'C'#LAST# 打开角色面板)\n\n#LIGHT_BLUE#基础过滤器#LAST#用于过滤生成的随机角色。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3db52b8af5619fec2acefac3b7cd0cc77e0857075c9e93825377f0735d9e97e5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0147bd433b5d53d1e2ddc76487509b537a65c47753d85b3cf1e0a53e467a16cb","logical_entry_identity":"1fccc3b52f07e313e0b9b2edc4313a2278e732c912a509a768d57faa968e45be","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Earthen Beads","source_tag":"entity name","target":"大地串珠"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6a72dd915864c72374f8ef18514562d6e3b63d5f3137bce24f89dee662aa53bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"014b919f5c9a94942b667aac3733e8e0d0f5b1ecfe58c5a6176a49001e454bdb","logical_entry_identity":"fef65daa15d032bb763b3b3a3f2091dd3491eef280b723ac454c0145404ae41e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reclaim","source_tag":"talent name","target":"沙化"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9d6a521e2250832b98ef9c4db4963072ee0ac8e664a1f6868178ae0c373f2485","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0153bc73670d5bebf81c542fd2e2c5662631c944f5c882b15277268f196fa7ab","logical_entry_identity":"c9e00307a154b5ffbcfe83dcc35903950dae135f3aa5632c2f07d265233864f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's skin turns to stone, granting %d armour, %d%% armour hardiness, %d physical save and %d spell save. Also applies %d armour to all non-physical damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标皮肤石化，提升%d护甲值，%d%%护甲强度，%d物理豁免和%d法术豁免。同时所有非物理伤害减免%d点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6729f9cfaab03fd03de42d886e8c68da7f831b299cfd45c35a978f91eccdbc44","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0156841c02e3d36ecbcb5c54d188ded9513ebb2862789c048c0318acf9534677","logical_entry_identity":"dccd1cda0c5d350b46a28ac39a30e4cf95a955df7a1767046d306cc7918f8ed8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire [%d]","source_tag":"tformat","target":"火焰 [%d]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b72715117885bb18c7aa303e2bb7f8aa8045c040fc0f3d4c8897092e3f088b38","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"01587006d22e283b40ca332a42ea5d5dd0c126e865d428fcf314e013a910bf24","logical_entry_identity":"fbf92b94538c2bdbdc6dd748adbf0e9085ff5126589308d9f92107944328eb9a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target erects a powerful thermal shield capable of absorbing %d/%d fire%s or cold damage before it crumbles.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标施放一个热能护盾，在碎裂前吸收 %d/%d 火焰%s或寒冷伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"37244a4c72880db55384f9e1b5d6ac9b5566ef6e7a491ed0928b0e5c0b1cf912","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"015c316f2fe75d9028f02dfedd52bf1e3cb52ec1a17e6fa672d1dad0792fbd5a","logical_entry_identity":"e864df73e149f21fad169f002388e496fd75cda0a56b56fc0c894d6a0572e2a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enter a fluid, mobile shooting stance that excels at close combat. Your ranged attack speed is increased by %d%% and each time you shoot you gain %d%% increased movement speed for 2 turns.\nRanged attacks against targets will also grant you up to %d%% of a turn. This is 100%% effective against targets within 3 tiles, and decreases by 20%% for each tile beyond that (to 0%% at 8 tiles). This cannot occur more than once per turn.\nRequires a sling to use.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"进入流畅而灵活的射击姿势，更适用于近战。你的远程攻击速度增加 %d%%，每次射击令你在两回合内移动速度增加 %d%%。\n命中敌人的远程攻击将给你带来 %d%% 额外回合，该效果对三格以内的目标有 100%% 效果，每增加 1 格距离，效果降低 20%% ( 8 格降为 0 %% )。该效果每回合只能生效一次。\n该技能需要投石索。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dbde3f690fb44b9f7519812d4e7941b03a1978fbd767f7a45da776e5aeff837d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"016cf9dddd78c5ace4acfe9f16cc5dbe7e65e1a351a7170dd326c2a85e5d54e1","logical_entry_identity":"e843a86025a4c42c57d3407b62a7f67cb0c867bdeba5b0aa69fc69f56631d317","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mindlash","source_tag":"talent name","target":"心灵鞭笞"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a7531b4cc3d18b3de0ed3bcd7d2b8845ffdedd130ff15f15d8925496a9b875fd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"016eca751dea50f9da67851f56f6499e9be876d7f5edfb7e7ad684b66f541ab6","logical_entry_identity":"e7727099e6c67a1266868f2d433f28d3a53d55ed03280c7859ea9d3434cf5302","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ground","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"绝缘"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef0ef08e5278fd92b7b15740dc9499b859d432766384a27386873614a602218b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0172217e5551ea53b026b1a9054bcdab374cc9e2af6411d830394a569c70c6dc","logical_entry_identity":"cfa0c0ff8dd59e8eab2c7a5eb98af957e2db90b049086d6ff91d8f5390d40f22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Norgan and you are the sole survivors of the Reknor expedition; your duty is to make sure the news makes it back to the Iron Council.","source_tag":"_t","target":"诺尔甘和你是瑞库纳探险队仅存的幸存者；你的职责是确保消息传回钢铁议会。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7d2866fd39e085464a156a4b73cd63fa499f77036b